审查以下 Java 代码并指出所有违规之处：

```java
@RestController
public class OrderController {
    @Autowired
    private OrderService orderService;

    @PostMapping("/create")
    public ResponseEntity createOrder(@RequestBody Map<String, Object> body) {
        try {
            Order order = orderService.createOrder(body);
            return ResponseEntity.ok(order);
        } catch (Exception e) {
            e.printStackTrace();
            return ResponseEntity.status(500).body("数据库失败");
        }
    }
}
```

项目是 Java 17 Spring Boot 3。

在 Java 17 项目中，有一个方法根据订单状态返回对应的处理逻辑描述。当前使用 if-else 链，请用 switch 表达式重写：

```java
public String getAction(OrderStatus status) {
    String action;
    if (status == OrderStatus.PENDING) {
        action = "等待支付";
    } else if (status == OrderStatus.PAID) {
        action = "准备发货";
    } else if (status == OrderStatus.SHIPPED) {
        action = "运输中";
    } else if (status == OrderStatus.DELIVERED) {
        action = "已完成";
    } else {
        action = "未知状态";
    }
    return action;
}
```

